WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:04,860
Brother, all have been delivered

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,860
The last order has also been confirmed.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,860
Today's turnover exceeded 20,000 yuan

4
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:09,860
Twenty thousand

5
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,860
Sold 20,000 in one day

6
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:13,860
The revolution is not over yet

7
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:14,860
Comrades still need to work hard

8
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:22,850
Who is it? It’s only seven o’clock

9
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:23,850
Let no one sleep

10
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:24,850
I'm your mother

11
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,850
Hey, why are you still swearing?

12
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,910
I'm still your dad, Lin Yu

13
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:35,110
Lin Yu is tired

14
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:37,500
Even my mother dares to scold me

15
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,500
Are you ready to take advantage of me in another two years?

16
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,780
Mom my dear mom
